Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.33,0:02:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A stranger's not allowed \Nto save this country?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Eight days before the great battle...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.89,0:02:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}...Luffy and the others had conquered Udon\Nunbeknownst to the enemy's main army.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.11,0:02:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"Warriors' Dream!\NLuffy's Conquer of Udon!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Defeat Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.47,0:02:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One, two, hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One, two, hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.31,0:02:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One, two, hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.31,0:02:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys can't back down anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffy... Where did he go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Killer...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.24,0:03:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.23,0:03:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you gonna fight Kaido again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you wanna join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.49,0:04:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.80,0:04:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look what happened to my buddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank me for not killing \Nyou right here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm sick of forming alliances.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I won't believe anyone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.05,0:05:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.81,0:05:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To take back our crewmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're gonna go our own way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look what 20 years can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is very hard to keep \Nbelieving in a hopeful dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They could not wait more than 10 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They became impatient\Nand went to Onigashima...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And they all died!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's been 10 years!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:47.11,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,10 YEARS AGO
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We've grown so old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we wait for 20 years,\Nwe'll get even weaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.11,0:06:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you asking us to wait for those people\Nwhose return isn't guaranteed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Believe in Toki-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s words...\NBelieve in them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kin'emon will come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:07:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Along with Momonosuke-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We have nothing to eat\Nsince we don't submit ourselves to Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Disease will kill us before a fight does!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kaido's army!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you destroy the well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.25,0:07:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't take it anymore, Shutenmaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.86,0:07:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let us go and take down Kaido...\Nand Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna just grow old\Nand die without doing anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! Your death will be senseless!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.16,0:08:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have no chance unless you form a big army\Nunder Kozuki's banner!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.41,0:08:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let us at least die holding our swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we die, we wanna die as samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.77,0:08:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't stop us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.09,0:08:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Let us go!\N--Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You men, calm down!\NRisking your lives now will not change a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.32,0:08:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're not cowards like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.49,0:08:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll choose how we die ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Let us go!\N--Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let us have our revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All that you've borne will have been in vain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you go now, you cannot avenge Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:09:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You all know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember? When we were kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We used to shout out that word\Nand test our courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.01,0:09:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, placing too much value on yourself\Nmakes people cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.77,0:09:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Su{\i0}-rrender your {\i1}na{\i0}-me and be as a {\i1}chi{\i0}-ld.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take the leap without thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what the word means!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Raise your voice! Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.39,0:10:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If we die, we wanna die as samurai!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.45,0:11:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.56,0:11:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.31,0:11:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.13,0:11:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sunacchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did it have to take 20 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.26,0:12:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We will know once this is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There must be a meaning to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.47,0:12:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have no reason to distrust Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.11,0:13:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eight days from now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the night of the Fire Festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.79,0:13:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,in the name of Kozuki,\Nwe will raid Onigashima...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...to take the pirate Kaido\Nand the Shogun Orochi's heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.50,0:13:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those of you who are determined,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.22,0:13:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.10,0:13:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course we will, Chief!\NWe've been waiting for this day for so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ashura!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.57,0:13:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys have not changed \Nsince that day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We were the same age at that time, but now that\Nwe've lived 20 years longer, we are stronger than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.37,0:13:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, doggie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:13:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, you are right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.67,0:14:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up, you old farts! \NDo not get in our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.17,0:14:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You squirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.43,0:14:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa-whoa, stop!\NNo one can stop a fight among the Akazaya members!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:32.16,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,UDON
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A pirate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.83,0:14:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The straw hat guy is a pirate\Njust like Kaido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, he is, but he is different!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.05,0:14:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't trust him!\NWe know he'll betray us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.25,0:14:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of all people, why did you bring a pirate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the world is big\Nand there are many different kinds of pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That man is crucial for \Nus to bring down Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.19,0:14:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--How can we trust him?!\N--We need a good explanation!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.97,0:14:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Oh, no. We are missing something.\NThey came to their senses, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.68,0:15:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,First of all, is it true\Nthat you came from 20 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Raizo-{\i1}san{\i0}, you always looked \Nolder than your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So we can't tell\Nif you've actually aged 20 years or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You might not mean to,\Nbut you are hurting my feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did the straw hat man go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tama, you shouldn't have come this far.\NIt's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.10,0:15:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm glad that you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.80,0:15:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--He is barely alive.\N--What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.09,0:15:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Big Bro, show some guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.03,0:15:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.93,0:15:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll find an antibody soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.23,0:15:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't have pretended\Nthat it wouldn't affect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It must be painful!\NWhy didn't you think it through?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Say sorry to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.65,0:15:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.87,0:15:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.36,0:15:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.41,0:15:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We thank them! But now that we know they're pirates,\Nwe won't join with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! Then we can't take down Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw hat man is trustworthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.17,0:16:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pirates are all the same to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.05,0:16:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't need pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kick them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Luffy may be stupid but he is quite special.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.03,0:16:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I could not have done something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Momo, you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...a real idiot...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and a coward...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and a weakling...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.37,0:16:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and a wimp...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! You are so rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have no business talking to me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.80,0:16:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Momo-{\i1}kun{\i0}, don't hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:17:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you, a chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am Kozuki Momonosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.48,0:17:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kozuki Oden's son!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.31,0:17:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then go, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kick them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.03,0:17:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We won't trust pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kick them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.01,0:17:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.91,0:17:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S-Stop, you fool!\NAre you going to kill me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who do you think they're waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.90,0:17:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.05,0:18:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Momonosuke-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Oh, yeah...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.06,0:19:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What we were missing was...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}...a dream.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.90,0:19:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What lies ahead of this battle!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.36,0:19:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It is not me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I think what everyone is seeing\Nis my father...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The great shadow of Kozuki\Nthat protected the Land of Wano!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I-I cannot do it...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I cannot!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.20,0:20:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to bring down Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Momonosuke!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.01,0:20:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Do not be afraid, Momonosuke...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.43,0:20:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Do not be afraid, Momonosuke!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.86,0:20:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,E-Everyone, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.03,0:20:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.37,0:20:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened at Oden Castle that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.21,0:21:01.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I went on a journey searching for allies\Nalong with Kin'emon and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.71,0:21:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I strayed from them\Nand was floundering about helplessly in a dangerous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.51,0:21:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I could not come back without the help of\NLuffy and the others who I met along the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.64,0:21:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am not strong enough yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.65,0:21:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I will avenge everyone at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even through difficult times,\NI could carry on without giving up...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...because of one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.08,0:21:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To realize that, I need like-minded allies...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.64,0:21:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need the help of you all\Nwho are living in the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We all share one wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.35,0:21:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take back the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone... For the last 20 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.85,0:22:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,thank you for waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.16,0:22:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am the heir to the Daimyo \Nof the Land of the Wano...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.16,0:22:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Kozuki Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.67,0:22:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now is the time to rise up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.89,0:22:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am relieved to know that\NMomonosuke-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s grown up strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.72,0:22:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There is some place I urgently need to go.\NI promise I will join you all before the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.58,0:22:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. See you then!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.23,0:23:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Orochi has a plan!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.32,0:23:23.90,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Shogun's scheme drives \Nthe Straw Hats into a corner
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.90,0:23:27.73,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,and destroys the plot to \Ntake back the Land of Wano!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.07,0:23:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But to counteract this, Zorojuro, the swordsman, rises up!\NHe will punish the vice-ridden world!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"Orochi's Hunting Party! The Ninja Group vs. Zoro!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.05,0:23:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.38,0:23:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.38,0:23:48.38,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,
